msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "InputStream Client for FFmpeg streams (libavformat)"
msgstr "Cliant InputStream do shruthanna FFmpeg (libavformat)"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "InputStream Client for streams that can be opened by either FFmpeg's libavformat or Kodi's cURL. Common stream formats such as plain TS, HLS and DASH (without DRM) are supported as well as many others.[CR][CR]The addon also has support for Archive/Catchup services where there is a replay windows (usually in days) and can timeshift across that span.[CR][CR]For documenation visit: https://github.com/xbmc/inputstream.ffmpegdirect/blob/Matrix/README.md"
msgstr "Cliant InputStream le haghaidh sruthanna is féidir a oscailt le libavformat FFmpeg nó cURL Kodi. Tacaítear le formáidí srutha coitianta ar nós TS simplí, HLS agus DASH (gan DRM) chomh maith le go leor eile.[CR][CR]Tacaíonn an breiseán freisin le seirbhísí Cartlainne/Catchup ina bhfuil fuinneoga athsheinm (de ghnáth i laethanta) agus is féidir athrú ama a dhéanamh ar fud na tréimhse sin.[CR][CR]Chun doiciméadú a fháil, tabhair cuairt ar: https://github.com/xbmc/inputstream.ffmpegdirect/blob/Matrix/README.md"

