#. help info - HTTP Proxy
#. help-category: Network
msgctxt "#30600"
msgid "This category contains the settings for network configuration such as FFmpeg proxy and bandwidth limits."
msgstr "Tá na socruithe le haghaidh cumraíocht líonra amhail seachfhreastalaí FFmpeg agus teorainneacha bandaleithead sa chatagóir seo."

#. help: Network - useHttpProxy
msgctxt "#30601"
msgid "Whether or not a proxy should be used when opening with FFmpeg. Note that if opened using curl kodi's proxy settings will be used."
msgstr "Cibé acu ba chóir seachfhreastalaí a úsáid agus oscailt le FFmpeg á déanamh. Tabhair faoi deara, má osclaítear é ag baint úsáide as socruithe seachfhreastalaí curl kodi, go n-úsáidfear iad."

#. help: Network - httpProxyHost
msgctxt "#30602"
msgid "Configure the proxy server address."
msgstr "Cumraigh seoladh an fhreastalaí seachfhreastalaí."

#. help: Network- httpProxyPort
msgctxt "#30603"
msgid "Configure the proxy server port."
msgstr "Cumraigh an port freastalaí seachfhreastalaí."

#. help: Network - httpProxyUser
msgctxt "#30604"
msgid "Configure the proxy server username."
msgstr "Cumraigh ainm úsáideora an fhreastalaí seachfhreastalaí."

#. help: Network - httpProxyPassword
msgctxt "#30605"
msgid "Configure the proxy server password."
msgstr "Cumraigh pasfhocal an fhreastalaí seachfhreastalaí."

#. help: Network - streamBandwidth
msgctxt "#30606"
msgid "Use this value as a maximum when selecting which HLS stream to use."
msgstr "Úsáid an luach seo mar uasmhéid agus tú ag roghnú cén sruth HLS atá le húsáid."

#empty strings from id 30607 to 30619
#. help info - Timeshift
#. help-category: timeshift
msgctxt "#30620"
msgid "This category contains the settings for timeshift. Timeshifting allows you to pause live TV as well as move back and forward from your current position similar to playing back a recording."
msgstr "Tá na socruithe le haghaidh athrú ama sa chatagóir seo. Le hathrú ama, is féidir leat teilifís bheo a chur ar sos chomh maith le bogadh ar ais agus ar aghaidh ó do shuíomh reatha, cosúil le taifeadadh a sheinm."

#. help: Timeshift - timeshiftBufferPath
msgctxt "#30621"
msgid "The path used to store the timeshift buffer. The default is the [I]\"addon_data/inputstream.ffmpegdirect/timeshift\"[/I] folder in userdata. Note that this folder will be cleared  of timeshift files on Kodi startup. Only relevant when [I]\"inputstream.ffmpegdirect.stream_mode=timeshift\"[/I] property is passed to the addon."
msgstr "An cosán a úsáidtear chun an maolán aistrithe ama a stóráil. Is é an fillteán [I]\"addon_data/inputstream.ffmpegdirect/timeshift\"[/I] in userdata an réamhshocrú. Tabhair faoi deara go nglanfar comhaid aistrithe ama as an bhfillteán seo nuair a thosaítear Kodi. Ní bhaineann sé seo ach nuair a chuirtear an mhaoin [I]\"inputstream.ffmpegdirect.stream_mode=timeshift\"[/I] chuig an mbreiseán."

#. help: Timeshift - timeshiftEnableLimit
msgctxt "#30622"
msgid "Enable this option to limit the length of the timeshift buffer. If disabled the buffer will grow forever until playback is stopped. Regardless of this setting the buffer will also grow forever if paused."
msgstr "Cumasaigh an rogha seo chun fad an mhaoláin aistrithe ama a theorannú. Má tá sé díchumasaithe, fásfaidh an maolán go deo go dtí go stopfar an athsheinm. Beag beann ar an socrú seo, fásfaidh an maolán go deo freisin má chuirtear ar sos é."

#. help: Timeshift - timeshiftOnDiskLength
msgctxt "#30623"
msgid "The length of the timeshift buffer in hours. Once the value is reached the older buffer data will be deleted to ensure the limit is not breached. Note that the storage for your device should be sufficient to allow the buffer to grow to it's maximum length (otherwise it's equivalent to disabling this option). A good heuristic for video size is 130MB per minute of 1080p video and 375MB per minute of 4K video."
msgstr "Fad an mhaoláin aistrithe ama in uaireanta an chloig. Nuair a shroichtear an luach, scriosfar na sonraí maoláin níos sine lena chinntiú nach sárófar an teorainn. Tabhair faoi deara gur cheart go mbeadh dóthain stórais ar do ghléas chun ligean don mhaolán fás go dtí a uasfhad (seach sin is ionann é agus an rogha seo a dhíchumasú). Is heorastach maith do mhéid físeáin 130MB in aghaidh an nóiméid de fhíseán 1080p agus 375MB in aghaidh an nóiméid de fhíseán 4K."

#empty strings from id 30624 to 30639
#. help info - Advanced
#. help-category: advanced
msgctxt "#30640"
msgid "Advanced settings"
msgstr "Socruithe ardleibhéil"

#. help: Advanced - allowFFmpegLogging
msgctxt "#30641"
msgid "If enabled the addon will log any FFmpeg logging to the Kodi log."
msgstr "Má tá sé cumasaithe, logálfaidh an breiseán aon logáil FFmpeg chuig log Kodi."

#. help: Advanced - probeForFps
msgctxt "#30642"
msgid "Probe for frames per second. Default enabled. If disabled the value returned by the codec will be used."
msgstr "Déan cuardach ar fhrámaí in aghaidh an tsoicind. Cumasaithe roimh ré. Má tá sé díchumasaithe, úsáidfear an luach a sheolann an códac."

#. help: Advanced - enableTeletext
msgctxt "#30643"
msgid "Allow teletext. Default enabled."
msgstr "Ceadaigh teilitéacs. Cumasaithe roimh ré."

#. help: Advanced - useFastOpenForManifestStreams
msgctxt "#30644"
msgid "Streams which have a manifest file (e.g. HLD/DASH/Smooth Streaming) can be opened more quickly with FFmpeg with this option enabled."
msgstr "Is féidir sruthanna a bhfuil comhad manifíse acu (e.g. HLD/DASH/Smooth Streaming) a oscailt níos tapúla le FFmpeg agus an rogha seo cumasaithe."

#. help: Advanced - forceRealtimeOffCatchup
msgctxt "#30645"
msgid "For certain catchup streams such as HLS reporting that a live stream is not live can improve stream open times. If testing this option works for a catchup stream/provider, then add a [I]\"#KODIPROP=inputstream.ffmpegdirect.is_realtime_stream=false\"[/I] to the M3U entry in question. This setting should not be left enabled for all streams."
msgstr "I gcás sruthanna áirithe athghabhála amhail HLS, is féidir feabhas a chur ar amanna oscailte an tsrutha trí thuairisciú nach bhfuil sruth beo beo. Má oibríonn tástáil an rogha seo do shruth/soláthraí athghabhála, cuir [I]\"#KODIPROP=inputstream.ffmpegdirect.is_realtime_stream=false\"[/I] leis an iontráil M3U atá i gceist. Níor cheart an socrú seo a fhágáil cumasaithe do gach sruth."
